BT /F1 8 Tf 72 750 Td (\n===== 1. OVERVIEW =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 738.8 Td (CloudSystem is a Spring Boot 4.1.1 microservice for distributed cloud file storage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 727.5999999999999 Td (Written in Java 17, using Spring Data JPA + PostgreSQL for persistence,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 716.3999999999999 Td (JWT \(Auth0 library\) for stateless authentication, and STOMP WebSocket for node communication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 705.1999999999998 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 693.9999999999998 Td (WHAT IT DOES TODAY:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 682.7999999999997 Td (  - User registration/login with BCrypt password hashing + JWT token) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 671.5999999999997 Td (  - File upload: stores metadata in DB, computes SHA-256 checksum) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 660.3999999999996 Td (  - Storage node registration + heartbeat tracking) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 649.1999999999996 Td (  - File replication: creates replica records for 3 online nodes \(PENDING status\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 637.9999999999995 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 626.7999999999995 Td (WHAT IT DOES NOT DO YET \(MVP placeholders\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 615.5999999999995 Td (  - Actual file bytes transfer to storage nodes \(replicas are metadata-only\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 604.3999999999994 Td (  - ContainerService.buildContainer/extractContainer are passthrough stubs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 593.1999999999994 Td (  - File download returns empty byte array) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 581.9999999999993 Td (  - No WebSocket message handlers implemented) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 570.7999999999993 Td (  - UserServiceImpl.getCurrentUser\(\) returns null) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 559.5999999999992 Td (  - JWT secret is hardcoded in source code) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 548.3999999999992 Td (\n===== 2. ARCHITECTURE & FLOW =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 537.1999999999991 Td (Request lifecycle for every REST call:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 525.9999999999991 Td (    > HTTP Request -> SecurityFilter \(JWT validation\) -> Controller -> Service -> Repository -> DB) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 514.799999999999 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 503.59999999999906 Td (SecurityFilter \(OncePerRequestFilter\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 492.39999999999907 Td (  1. Reads Authorization header) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 481.1999999999991 Td (  2. If Bearer token present, validates via TokenConfig.validateToken\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 469.9999999999991 Td (  3. If valid: creates UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken with JWTUserData,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 458.7999999999991 Td (     sets it in SecurityContextHolder.getContext\(\).setAuthentication\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 447.5999999999991 Td (  4. If invalid/missing: does NOT set authentication -> request proceeds unauthenticated) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 436.3999999999991 Td (     \(but SecurityConfig requires auth for all non-/auth endpoints -> 403\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 425.19999999999914 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 413.99999999999915 Td (CRITICAL: filterChain.doFilter\(\) is called in BOTH branches \(valid token and no token\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 402.79999999999916 Td (so the filter always lets the request proceed. The difference is whether the SecurityContext) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 391.59999999999917 Td (has an Authentication object. @AuthenticationPrincipal on controller methods extracts it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 380.3999999999992 Td (\n===== 3. SECURITY ARCHITECTURE \(DETAILED\) =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 369.1999999999992 Td (  >> 3.1 SecurityConfig) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 357.9999999999992 Td (@Configuration @EnableWebSecurity) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 346.7999999999992 Td (    - CSRF disabled \(stateless REST API\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 335.5999999999992 Td (    - CORS configured for localhost:5173, 127.0.0.1:5173, 127.0.0.1:5500) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 324.39999999999924 Td (    - Session policy: STATELESS \(no HttpSession\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 313.19999999999925 Td (    - PermitAll: POST /auth/login, POST /auth/register, ERROR dispatcher) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 301.99999999999926 Td (    - Authenticated: ALL other requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 290.7999999999993 Td (    - Filter chain: SecurityFilter added BEFORE UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 279.5999999999993 Td (    - Beans: AuthenticationManager, BCryptPasswordEncoder, CorsConfigurationSource) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 268.3999999999993 Td (  >> 3.2 SecurityFilter) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 257.1999999999993 Td (@Component, extends OncePerRequestFilter \(runs once per request\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 245.99999999999932 Td (Reads 'Authorization' header -> extracts Bearer token -> validates -> sets context.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 234.79999999999933 Td (BUG: If token is present but INVALID \(expired/wrong\), it silently passes through) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 223.59999999999934 Td (     because filterChain.doFilter\(\) is called in the else branch regardless.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 212.39999999999935 Td (     The authentication just won't be set, and the endpoint will return 403.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 201.19999999999936 Td (  >> 3.3 TokenConfig) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 189.99999999999937 Td (@Component - JWT encode/decode using HMAC256 \(secret hardcoded\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 178.7999999999994 Td (generateToken\(User\): claims={userID}, subject=email, expires=24h, issuedAt=now) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 167.5999999999994 Td (validateToken\(String\): returns Optional<JWTUserData> or empty on JWTVerificationException) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 156.3999999999994 Td (WARNING: secret 'Evgueny25087Nenane' is in source code - should be env var) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 145.19999999999942 Td (  >> 3.4 AuthConfig) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 133.99999999999943 Td (@Service implements UserDetailsService) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 122.79999999999943 Td (loadUserByUsername\(email\) -> userRepository.findUserByEmail\(email\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 111.59999999999943 Td (Used by Spring Security's AuthenticationManager during login) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 100.39999999999942 Td (  >> 3.5 JWTUserData) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 89.19999999999942 Td (@Builder record\(userID: Long, email: String\)) Tj ET

endstream
endobj
