BT /F1 8 Tf 72 750 Td (Carries user identity after JWT validation. Used as 'principal' in SecurityContext.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 738.8 Td (\n===== 4. ENTITY CLASSES \(DETAILED\) =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 727.5999999999999 Td (  >> 4.1 User implements UserDetails) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 716.3999999999999 Td (    - @Entity\(name='Users'\) -> table 'Users') Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 705.1999999999998 Td (    - userID: Long PK AUTO_INCREMENT) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 693.9999999999998 Td (    - name, surname, email: String\(100\), NOT NULL) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 682.7999999999997 Td (    - password: String, NOT NULL \(BCrypt encoded\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 671.5999999999997 Td (    - registrationData: LocalDateTime, NOT NULL) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 660.3999999999996 Td (    - lastAccess: LocalDateTime \(nullable, not currently set anywhere\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 649.1999999999996 Td (    - role: @ManyToOne Role, FK roleID) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 637.9999999999995 Td (UserDetails methods:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 626.7999999999995 Td (    - getAuthorities\(\) -> ['ROLE_' + role.getName\(\)] \(or empty if role==null\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 615.5999999999995 Td (    - getUsername\(\) -> email) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 604.3999999999994 Td (    - getPassword\(\) -> inherited from entity -> password field) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 593.1999999999994 Td (    - isAccountNonExpired/NonLocked/CredentialsNonExpired -> default true \(from UserDetails\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 581.9999999999993 Td (NOTE: User does NOT implement getPassword\(\) explicitly - Spring Security uses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 570.7999999999993 Td (       the password field directly via reflection since it's a JPA entity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 559.5999999999992 Td (  >> 4.2 Role) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 548.3999999999992 Td (    - @Entity\(name='Roles'\) -> table 'Roles') Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 537.1999999999991 Td (    - roleID: Long PK, name: String unique NOT NULL) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 525.9999999999991 Td (    - users: @OneToMany mappedBy='role' \(inverse side\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 514.799999999999 Td (  >> 4.3 StorageNode) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 503.59999999999906 Td (    - @Entity\(name='StorageNodes'\) -> table 'StorageNodes') Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 492.39999999999907 Td (    - nodeID PK, owner @ManyToOne User \(FK ownerID\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 481.1999999999991 Td (    - name String\(100\) NOT NULL) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 469.9999999999991 Td (    - status NodeStatus enum DEFAULT OFFLINE) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 458.7999999999991 Td (    - totalSpaceBytes NOT NULL, usedSpaceBytes default 0) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 447.5999999999991 Td (    - lastHeartbeat, sessionId, createdAt) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 436.3999999999991 Td (    - getFreeSpaceBytes\(\) = totalSpaceBytes - usedSpaceBytes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 425.19999999999914 Td (NOTE: 'createdAt' is never set in NodeController.registerNode\(\) - will be NULL in DB!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 413.99999999999915 Td (  >> 4.4 FileMetadata) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 402.79999999999916 Td (    - @Entity\(name='FileMetadata'\) -> table 'FileMetadata') Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 391.59999999999917 Td (    - fileID PK, owner @ManyToOne User) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 380.3999999999992 Td (    - originalName\(255\), mimeType\(150\), originalSizeBytes, storedSizeBytes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 369.1999999999992 Td (    - checksumSha256\(64\) - SHA-256 hex of raw file bytes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 357.9999999999992 Td (    - containerVersion default 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 346.7999999999992 Td (    - encryptedDataKey TEXT \(AES-256 key, Base64 - NOT actually encrypted in MVP\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 335.5999999999992 Td (    - keyEncryptionIv String\(64\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 324.39999999999924 Td (    - uploadedAt NOT NULL) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 313.19999999999925 Td (    - replicas @OneToMany mappedBy='file', cascade=ALL, orphanRemoval=true) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 301.99999999999926 Td (NOTE: storedSizeBytes = originalSizeBytes in MVP \(no actual compression/encryption\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 290.7999999999993 Td (NOTE: encryptedDataKey/keyEncryptionIv are stored but not actually used for encryption) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 279.5999999999993 Td (  >> 4.5 FileReplica) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 268.3999999999993 Td (    - @Entity\(name='FileReplicas'\) -> table 'FileReplicas') Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 257.1999999999993 Td (    - replicaID PK, file @ManyToOne FileMetadata, node @ManyToOne StorageNode) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 245.99999999999932 Td (    - status ReplicaStatus DEFAULT PENDING, remotePath, updatedAt) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 234.79999999999933 Td (This is the link table between FileMetadata and StorageNode with status tracking.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 223.59999999999934 Td (  >> 4.6 Enums) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 212.39999999999935 Td (    - NodeStatus: ONLINE, OFFLINE, DEGRADED) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 201.19999999999936 Td (    - ReplicaStatus: PENDING, SYNCED, FAILED) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 189.99999999999937 Td (\n===== 5. REPOSITORY LAYER =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 178.7999999999994 Td (All extend JpaRepository<T, Long> -> standard save/findAll/findById/delete) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 167.5999999999994 Td (  >> UserRepository) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 156.3999999999994 Td (    - findUserByEmail\(String\) -> Optional<UserDetails>) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 145.19999999999942 Td (Used by AuthConfig \(UserDetailsService\) and AuthController \(email uniqueness check\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 133.99999999999943 Td (  >> RoleRepository) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 122.79999999999943 Td (    - Standard CRUD only) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 111.59999999999943 Td (Used by AuthController to assign role ID 3 on registration) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 100.39999999999942 Td (  >> StorageNodeRepository) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 89.19999999999942 Td (    - findAllByOwner\(User\) - all nodes owned by a user) Tj ET

endstream
