BT /F1 8 Tf 72 380.3999999999992 Td (  2. Sets status=ONLINE, lastHeartbeat=now) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 369.1999999999992 Td (  3. Saves node) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 357.9999999999992 Td (  NOTE: Does NOT verify the node belongs to the authenticated user!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 346.7999999999992 Td (  SECURITY RISK: Any authenticated user can heartbeat any node by ID) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 335.5999999999992 Td (\n===== 8. DTO LAYER =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 324.39999999999924 Td (  >> Request DTOs \(records\)) Tj ET
