BT /F1 8 Tf 72 750 Td (    > POST /auth/register {name, surname, email, password}) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 738.8 Td (  1. RegisterUserRequest validated \(@NotEmpty\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 727.5999999999999 Td (  2. New User entity created) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 716.3999999999999 Td (  3. password = BCryptPasswordEncoder.encode\(password\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 705.1999999999998 Td (  4. registrationData = LocalDateTime.now\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 693.9999999999998 Td (  5. role = roleRepository.getReferenceById\(3L\)  // assumes role 3 exists in DB) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 682.7999999999997 Td (  6. isEmailUnique\(email\) checked -> 409 if exists) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 671.5999999999997 Td (  7. userRepository.save\(newUser\)  // generates userID) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 660.3999999999996 Td (  8. tokenConfig.generateToken\(newUser\)  // JWT with userID claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 649.1999999999996 Td (  9. Returns 201 + RegisterUserResponse) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 637.9999999999995 Td (ASSUMPTION: Role with ID=3 must exist in the database beforehand) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 626.7999999999995 Td (  >> 10.2 File Upload \(full step-by-step\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 615.5999999999995 Td (    > POST /files/upload + MultipartFile + Bearer JWT) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 604.3999999999994 Td (  1. SecurityFilter validates JWT -> sets SecurityContext) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 593.1999999999994 Td (  2. @AuthenticationPrincipal User extracted from SecurityContext) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 581.9999999999993 Td (  3. ContainerService.uploadFile\(\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 570.7999999999993 Td (     a. file.getBytes\(\) -> raw bytes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 559.5999999999992 Td (     b. sha256Hex\(rawData\) -> checksum) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 548.3999999999992 Td (     c. FileMetadata.builder\(\) with all fields) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 537.1999999999991 Td (     d. fileMetadataRepository.save\(metadata\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 525.9999999999991 Td (     e. returns saved.getFileID\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 514.799999999999 Td (  4. ReplicationService.replicateFile\(fileID\) [async, @Transactional]:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 503.59999999999906 Td (     a. Loads FileMetadata) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 492.39999999999907 Td (     b. nodeRepository.findAllByStatus\(ONLINE\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 481.1999999999991 Td (     c. Sorts by freeSpaceBytes desc, takes top 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 469.9999999999991 Td (     d. If <3 nodes: logs warning, aborts) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 458.7999999999991 Td (     e. For each node: FileReplica.builder\(\).file\(metadata\).node\(node\).status\(PENDING\).save\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 447.5999999999991 Td (  5. Returns UploadResponse\(fileID, filename, contentType, size\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 436.3999999999991 Td (  >> 10.3 Node Heartbeat \(full step-by-step\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 425.19999999999914 Td (    > POST /nodes/{nodeId}/heartbeat + Bearer JWT) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 413.99999999999915 Td (  1. nodeRepository.findById\(nodeId\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 402.79999999999916 Td (  2. If found: set status=ONLINE, lastHeartbeat=now, save) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 391.59999999999917 Td (  3. If not found: return 404) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 380.3999999999992 Td (SECURITY NOTE: No ownership check - any authenticated user can heartbeat any node) Tj ET
