BT /F1 8 Tf 72 313.19999999999925 Td (\n===== 15. BUGS, ISSUES & IMPROVEMENTS =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 301.99999999999926 Td (CRITICAL:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 290.7999999999993 Td (    - JWT secret hardcoded in source - must use env variable or key vault) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 279.5999999999993 Td (    - StorageNode.createdAt never set in NodeController -> NULL in DB) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 268.3999999999993 Td (    - Node heartbeat has no ownership verification - any user can heartbeat any node) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 257.1999999999993 Td (    - Replication only creates DB records - no actual file data transfer to nodes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 245.99999999999932 Td (    - File download returns empty bytes - not functional) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 234.79999999999933 Td (MAJOR:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 223.59999999999934 Td (    - UserServiceImpl.getCurrentUser\(\) returns null - SecurityContextHolder not wired) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 212.39999999999935 Td (    - isEmailUnique\(\) naming is confusing \(returns true when email EXISTS\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 201.19999999999936 Td (    - ContainerService.buildContainer/extractContainer are passthrough stubs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 189.99999999999937 Td (    - No WebSocket message handlers despite WebSocketConfig) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 178.7999999999994 Td (    - Role ID 3 hardcoded in registration - fragile, should use role name) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 167.5999999999994 Td (    - No validation on file size in upload endpoint) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 156.3999999999994 Td (    - No pagination on file list or node list endpoints) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 145.19999999999942 Td (MINOR:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 133.99999999999943 Td (    - System.out.println used for logging instead of proper logger) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 122.79999999999943 Td (    - FileMetadata.entity name 'FileMetadata' vs table 'FileMetadata' - OK but confusing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 111.59999999999943 Td (    - ReplicationService uses raw class name inline instead of import) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 100.39999999999942 Td (\n===== 16. HOW ALL CLASSES WORK TOGETHER - RUNTIME FLOW =====\n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 72 89.19999999999942 Td (STARTUP:) Tj ET

